Package: thermogramforge.core
Title: Core Algorithms for Thermal Liquid Biopsy Thermogram Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Karl", "Reger", , "kcr28@nau.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Robert", "Buscaglia", role = "aut"))
Description: Baseline-endpoint detection, baseline subtraction, signal
    classification, and metric calculation for differential scanning
    calorimetry thermograms of blood plasma. Pure R, no Shiny. Carries a
    frozen reference implementation of the methods published in Reger et al.
    (Cancers, 2025) alongside the current defaults.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    S7 (>= 0.2.1),
    forecast (>= 9.0),
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    waldo,
    data.table
Config/testthat/edition: 3
